shortdesc Assemble multiple logical pages onto a physical page
relocated 1
longdesc This package replaces and extends the pgfpages sub-package of
longdesc the PGF system. It provides the capability to arrange multiple
longdesc "logical" pages on multiple "physical" pages, for example as
longdesc for arranging pages to make booklets.
